OL,3,GNEWSANarrowboat restoration volunteers 
OL,4,Awin national award                     
OL,6,FA community project to restore an      
OL,7,FEdwardian narrowboat and turn it into a
OL,8,Ftravelling community space has been    
OL,9,Frecognised with a national award.      
OL,11,FThe Jericho Living Heritage Trust is   
OL,12,Fcurrently working to bring the         
OL,13,F113-year-old narrowboat Kilsby back to 
OL,14,Flife, with 36 volunteers working on the
OL,15,Fproject.                               
OL,17,FHaving saved the vessel from a watery  
OL,18,Fgrave, the volunteers are now          
OL,19,Ftransforming the rare boat into a fully
OL,20,Faccessible "floating classroom" and    
OL,21,Fvenue for Oxford.                      
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
